<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="49BIzRBWixK0pJI3NNQp">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3323" dy="1813" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Customer as Customer\n    participant UI as Kiosk UI\n    participant API as Backend Spring Boot\n    participant DB as MySQL DB\n    participant Pay as Payment Provider\n    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker\n    participant Dev as Device / Simulator\n\n    Note over Customer,Dev: 1. Luong tao don trai nghiem (SRS-ORDER-001, BR-003, BR-004, BR-010)\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;UI: Chon nuoc hoa (productId, slotId)\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/v1/orders (machineId, slotId, productId)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Kiem tra Machine ONLINE, Slot AVAILABLE, ton kho tren nguong\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Tra ve thong tin Machine, Slot, Product va Gia\n\n    alt May OFFLINE, MAINTENANCE hoac Slot EMPTY\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: 400/409 Error - May hoac khe khong kha dung\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Customer: Hien thi thong bao khong the tao don\n    else Du dieu kien tao don\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT orders PENDING_PAYMENT, payments PENDING, audit_logs\n        DB--&gt;&gt;API: Xac nhan luu thanh cong\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: 201 Created - orderId, qrCodeData, amount, expiresAt\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Customer: Hien thi ma QR thanh toan va dem nguoc thoi gian\n    end\n\n    Note over Customer,Dev: 2. Xac minh thanh toan va chong callback trung (SRS-PAY-001, BR-005)\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;Pay: Quet ma QR va thanh toan\n    Pay-&gt;&gt;API: POST /api/v1/payments/webhook - provider_reference, orderId, amount, signature, status\n    API-&gt;&gt;API: Xac minh chu ky va tinh hop le payload\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT payment va order theo provider_reference hoac orderId\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Tra ve trang thai hien tai cua Payment va Order\n\n    alt Callback trung lap - Payment da xu ly hoac status khac PENDING\n        API--&gt;&gt;Pay: 200 OK - Already Processed, khong phat lenh phun moi\n    else Chu ky sai, lech so tien, thanh toan THAT BAI hoac EXPIRED\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE payments FAILED, orders FAILED hoac EXPIRED, INSERT audit_logs\n        API--&gt;&gt;Pay: 200 OK hoac 400 Bad Request\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Cap nhat trang thai thanh toan that bai hoac het han\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Customer: Thong bao loi thanh toan\n    else Thanh toan HOP LE va THANH CONG\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE payments SUCCESS, orders PAID, INSERT audit_logs\n        API--&gt;&gt;Pay: 200 OK - Webhook Acknowledged\n    end\n\n    Note over Customer,Dev: 3. Kiem tra an toan va dieu phoi lenh phun (SRS-DISP-001, SRS-DISP-002, BR-007, BR-009)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Kiem tra lai Machine ONLINE, khong MAINTENANCE, khong DOOR_OPEN va Slot khong EMPTY\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Trang thai hien tai cua Machine va Slot\n\n    alt May mat ket noi hoac vi pham an toan sau khi thanh toan\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE orders REVIEW_REQUIRED, INSERT alerts va audit_logs\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Thong bao tam ngung phun va huong dan ho tro hoan tien\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Customer: Hien thi huong dan lien he ho tro\n    else May va Slot du dieu kien an toan\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT dispense_commands SENT va UPDATE orders DISPENSING\n        API-&gt;&gt;MQTT: Publish command voi commandId, orderId, slotId, expiresAt va sig\n        MQTT-&gt;&gt;Dev: Chuyen tiep lenh phun\n        Dev-&gt;&gt;Dev: Kiem tra commandId, han dung va an toan tai cho\n\n        alt Lenh trung lap - Duplicate commandId da xu ly\n            Dev--&gt;&gt;MQTT: Publish ACK hoac Result cu, khong phun lan 2\n        else Vi pham an toan tai thiet bi\n            Dev--&gt;&gt;MQTT: Publish event FAILED voi errorCode\n            MQTT--&gt;&gt;API: Chuyen ket qua tu choi phun\n            API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT dispense_results FAILED, UPDATE commands FAILED va orders REVIEW_REQUIRED\n            API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT alerts\n            API--&gt;&gt;UI: Thong bao khong the phun va huong dan ho tro\n        else Dieu kien hop le - Thuc hien phun mot lan duy nhat\n            Dev--&gt;&gt;MQTT: Publish ACK da nhan lenh commandId\n            Dev-&gt;&gt;Dev: Kich hoat co cau phun slotId trong mot chu ky dinh luong\n            Dev--&gt;&gt;MQTT: Publish event SUCCESS voi completedAt\n        end\n    end\n\n    Note over Customer,Dev: 4. Nhan ket qua, cap nhat ton kho va xu ly timeout (BR-011, BR-014)\n    alt Nhan ket qua THANH CONG tu thiet bi\n        MQTT--&gt;&gt;API: Nhan su kien SUCCESS voi commandId\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: Kiem tra trang thai commandId de chong phan hoi lap lai\n\n        alt Phan hoi MQTT bi lap - commandId da COMPLETED\n            API-&gt;&gt;API: Bo qua su kien lap, khong tru ton kho lan 2\n        else Lan dau nhan ket qua SUCCESS\n            API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT dispense_results SUCCESS, UPDATE commands COMPLETED, orders DISPENSED\n            API-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE cartridges tru 1 spray, INSERT inventory_transactions va audit_logs\n            API-&gt;&gt;DB: Kiem tra nguong ton kho va INSERT alerts LOW_STOCK neu can\n            API--&gt;&gt;UI: Cap nhat trang thai phun thanh cong\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Customer: Thong bao hoan tat trai nghiem\n        end\n    else Timeout hoac ket qua KHONG XAC DINH\n        Note over API,Dev: Timeout khong chung minh may chua phun, khong tu dong gui lenh phun lan 2\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE dispense_commands UNKNOWN hoac TIMEOUT, orders REVIEW_REQUIRED\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT alerts UNCERTAIN_DISPENSE_RESULT va audit_logs\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Hien thi trang thai can kiem tra va doi soat\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Customer: Thong bao su co va huong dan doi soat voi nhan vien\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="e1gBIUbyHeStcMCGMmln-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
